warning: HexMvPolyMathlib/Equiv.lean:193:4: `MvPolynomial.coeff_add` has been deprecated: Use `AddMonoidAlgebra.coeff_add` instead

Note: The updated constant has a different type:
  ∀ {R : Type u_1} {M : Type u_4} [inst : Semiring R] (x y : AddMonoidAlgebra R M), (x + y).coeff = x.coeff + y.coeff
instead of
